,"text":"\\label{cor:infinite-tensor}\nLet $D$ be a nonzero unital separable complex $C^*$-algebra without\ncharacters, and write\n\\[\n B=D^{\\otimes_{\\min}\\infty}\n :=\\varinjlim_{n\\ge1}\n \\bigl(D^{\\otimes_{\\min}n},\\,x\\longmapsto x\\otimes1_D\\bigr).\n\\]\nThen $B\\cong B\\otmin\\Z$, and $B$ contains a unital copy of $\\Z$."},{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:feb0389da2b2af2ca69b1de88316f2029001cd23b58a8454d787e539b428a179","grain":"paper-statement","id":"The-Kirchberg-Rordam-character-criterion-September-25-2026#prop:rw"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/a622d1901d5104620c0dd2d3.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Proposition","id":"r:The-Kirchberg-Rordam-character-criterion-September-25-2026:prop:rw","manuscript_id":"p:The-Kirchberg-Rordam-character-criterion-September-25-2026","name":"R\\o rdam--Winter","printed_number":"2.1","printed_number_provenance":{"atlas_pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","binding":{"file":"build/sections/preliminaries.tex","label":"prop:rw","line":46,"manuscript":"The-Kirchberg-Rordam-character-criterion-September-25-2026","statement_sha256":"d956ee9dfafb9ec2da82b7f28ce609cc07d414cc21e82ace64e64234c1d28562"},"blob_sha256":"sha256:253ae0683558fd095a71d6f47ab0694d8d98b846c1a65d2bbf9b145d484af567","kind":"reading-page-computed","pdf_verified":false,"pin":"c0851ae4ba3e12b1170cd4cdae33b48fae15d9a0","renderer":"scripts/build_papers.py","source":"data/statement_numbers.json","upstream_pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb"},"printed_number_status":"recorded","reading_page":"papers/The-Kirchberg-Rordam-character-criterion-September-25-2026.html#prop:rw","section":2,"section_title":"Preliminaries","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-en